  note: 'The Medieval Kingdom: a tiny gray baby dragon with her own cat face (folded ears, amber eyes), little wings and nub horns. She glides (hold Jump in the air) and puffs fire (her attack): torches, braziers, ropes, hay and brambles; rats run from it.'
